  "rounds": 2,
  "port": 8100,
  "description": "M3 - throughput vs latency at matched model/device/dtype (SmolLM2-135M, MPS fp16). Sequential = one request at a time (the M1 design); continuous = iteration-level batching (max 32 sequences, 512-token step budget). Prefix caching off everywhere to isolate batching. Closed-loop clients, prompt 128 tokens, 64 output tokens (ignore_eos).",
